nity orchestra plans to affiliate with a local music school.","example_zh":"社區管弦樂團計畫與當地音樂學校建立附屬關係。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/affiliate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-aggravate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"aggravate","sort_order":1,"sense":"加劇","alt_zh":"高中生坐著休息，老師示意他別用腫脹的腳踝站起來。","example":"Walking on the injured ankle could aggravate the swelling.","example_zh":"用受傷的腳踝走路可能加重腫脹。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/aggravate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-agony-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"agony","sort_order":1,"sense":"極度痛苦","alt_zh":"高中跑者坐在保健室床邊緊皺眉頭，護理師溫和檢查膝蓋。","example":"The runner sat in agony while the nurse examined his injured knee.","example_zh":"護理師檢查受傷的膝蓋時，跑者痛苦地坐著。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/agony-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-albeit-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"albeit","sort_order":1,"sense":"雖然","alt_zh":"雨後高中生查看仍挺立的幼苗，葉片有些破損但嫩芽完好。","example":"The seedlings survived the storm, albeit with a few broken leaves.","example_zh":"幼苗撐過了暴風雨，雖然有幾片葉子折斷。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/albeit-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-align-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"align","sort_order":1,"sense":"對齊","alt_zh":"高中生用直尺把幾片木板的邊緣排成筆直一線。","example":"Use the ruler to align the edges of the wooden pieces.","example_zh":"用尺把木片的邊緣對齊。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/align-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-allude-01-v1","level":"senior","word"