.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/astound-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-avid-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"avid","sort_order":1,"sense":"熱切的","alt_zh":"高中女生從裝著幾本小說的背包取出書，在樹下專注閱讀。","example":"As an avid reader, Mei always carries a novel in her backpack.","example_zh":"美是個熱愛閱讀的人，背包裡總帶著一本小說。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/avid-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-backlash-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"backlash","sort_order":1,"sense":"反彈","alt_zh":"居民與高中生聚在大樹旁，伸手示意反對，官員在旁認真傾聽。","example":"The plan to cut down the park's trees caused a strong public backlash.","example_zh":"砍掉公園樹木的計畫引發民眾強烈反彈。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/backlash-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-benchmark-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"benchmark","sort_order":1,"sense":"基準","alt_zh":"高中生把新的模型橋與中央展示的成功原型並排比較。","example":"The first successful model became a benchmark for the students' later designs.","example_zh":"第一個成功的模型成為學生之後設計的基準。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/benchmark-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-boom-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"boom","sort_order":1,"sense":"繁榮","alt_zh":"海邊小鎮的市集熱鬧繁忙，遊客排隊光顧攤販。","example":"The tourism boom brought more visitors to the seaside town.","example_zh":"觀光業的繁榮為海邊小鎮帶來更多遊客。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/boom-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-boycott-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"boycott","sort_order":1,"sense":"抵制","alt_zh":"高中生把層層塑膠包裝的商品放回架上，改選可重複使用的用品。","example":"The students decided t