ade","sort_order":1,"sense":"瀑布","alt_zh":"高中健行隊從安全觀景台欣賞清澈的階梯瀑布。","example":"A cascade of clear water tumbled over the rocks into the pool.","example_zh":"清澈的瀑布越過岩石，傾瀉進水潭。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/cascade-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-census-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"census","sort_order":1,"sense":"人口普查","alt_zh":"人口普查員拿著無字表格站在家門口，家人與高中孩子一起回答。","example":"A census worker visited each home to count the people living there.","example_zh":"人口普查員逐戶拜訪，統計住在各家的居民人數。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/census-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-circumvent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"circumvent","sort_order":1,"sense":"規避；繞過","alt_zh":"高中健行隊沿乾燥的側邊小路繞過主步道的大水坑。","example":"We used a side path to circumvent the flooded section of the trail.","example_zh":"我們走側邊的小路，繞過步道上淹水的路段。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/circumvent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-clarify-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"clarify","sort_order":1,"sense":"澄清","alt_zh":"老師指著橋梁模型的支架，原本疑惑的高中生露出理解表情。","example":"The teacher used a model to clarify how the bridge supports its weight.","example_zh":"老師用模型說明橋梁如何支撐重量。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/clarify-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-clash-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"clash","sort_order":1,"sense":"衝突","alt_zh":"兩隊高中生在球場入口指著同一座球場爭論，教練走近協調。","example":"The two teams began to clash over who could use the court first.","example_zh":"兩支隊伍為誰能先使用球場而發生衝突。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/