 markets around the world.","example_zh":"稻米是世界各地市場交易的重要商品。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/commodity-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-compatible-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"compatible","sort_order":1,"sense":"相容的","alt_zh":"高中生把新鍵盤接上教室電腦，螢幕上的無字幾何圖案正常回應。","example":"The new keyboard is compatible with the classroom computer.","example_zh":"新鍵盤與教室的電腦相容。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/compatible-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-compulsory-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"compulsory","sort_order":1,"sense":"強制的","alt_zh":"教練逐一檢查高中生騎車前是否戴好並扣緊安全帽。","example":"Wearing a helmet is compulsory during the school's cycling activity.","example_zh":"參加學校的腳踏車活動時，必須戴安全帽。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/compulsory-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-concede-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"concede","sort_order":1,"sense":"承認","alt_zh":"高中棋手看著落敗的棋局，坦然向勝出的對手伸手握手。","example":"After checking the score, the player had to concede defeat.","example_zh":"核對比分後，那位選手不得不承認落敗。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/concede-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-concise-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"concise","sort_order":1,"sense":"簡潔的","alt_zh":"高中女生用簡單三步驟無字圖示說明如何種苗，同學馬上動手。","example":"Her concise explanation helped everyone understand the task quickly.","example_zh":"她簡潔的說明幫助每個人迅速理解任務。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/concise-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-configure-01-v1","level":"se